{"data": [{"author_id": "1940892740952473600", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:09:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117725763864834139"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 244, "start": 237, "tag": "Nvidia"}], "urls": [{"description": "AICR comes out-of-the-box for Rubin day-one deployments", "display_url": "sdxcentral.com/news/nvidia-di…", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://www.sdxcentral.com/news/nvidia-dishes-ready-made-kubernetes-for-vera-rubin/", "images": [{"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117725767539073024/XRLd_Mgs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117725767539073024/XRLd_Mgs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 245, "status": 200, "title": "Nvidia dishes ready-made Kubernetes for Vera Rubin", "unwound_url": "https://www.sdxcentral.com/news/nvidia-dishes-ready-made-kubernetes-for-vera-rubin/", "url": "https://t.co/zWWX0UQVQL"}]}, "id": "2117725763864834139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia shipped AI Cluster Runtime: ready-made Kubernetes recipes for GPU clusters, with early presets for Vera Rubin NVL72. Nvidia labels the Rubin recipes early-adopter, not production-supported yet. Config pain is the real bottleneck. #Nvidia\nhttps://t.co/zWWX0UQVQL", "url": "https://x.com/asmDevsit/status/2117725763864834139"}, {"author_id": "864604226", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:07:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117725426688893240"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "ALAB"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/irD1HWTo1x", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JohnnyNorthstar/status/2117725426688893240/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117725319905849345", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/irD1HWTo1x"}]}, "id": "2117725426688893240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 509, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ALAB just fired the first shot of tonight’s AI referendum, and it’s a BLOWOUT: 🔌\n\n➤ EPS $1.32 vs $1.19 expected, an 11% beat\n➤ Revenue $585M vs $551M expected, a 6% beat\n➤ Revenue up 154% year over year\n➤ EPS up 169% year over year\n➤ And the sequential numbers are absurd: https://t.co/irD1HWTo1x", "url": "https://x.com/JohnnyNorthstar/status/2117725426688893240"}, {"author_id": "200924316", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:46:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117735236138152295"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/natolambert/st…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/natolambert/status/2117065900688118087", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/1utySaXDTj"}]}, "id": "2117735236138152295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117065900688118087", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ok this is wild. the AI buildout math comes out to $4.5T a year by 2027\n\nIf you build or buy AI compute, that number is the one everything else hangs on.\n\nNathan Lambert flagged a write-up that starts from SemiAnalysis power data. 50GW of new datacenter capacity lands by the end https://t.co/1utySaXDTj", "url": "https://x.com/x610ck/status/2117735236138152295"}, {"author_id": "2047141307861090304", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:50:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117736285364236734"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 59, "id": "260903261", "start": 47, "username": "jacobeffron"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AlR9vOBLyg", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PodcastAlphaX/status/2117736285364236734/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117736192057790464", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/AlR9vOBLyg"}, {"display_url": "x.com/PodcastAlphaX/…", "end": 320, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/PodcastAlphaX/status/2117683142521765927", "start": 297, "url": "https://t.co/gBIdnlLmiO"}]}, "id": "2117736285364236734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117683142521765927", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Danila Shtan, Nebius's CTO, tells Jacob Effron @jacobeffron a brand-new AI lab will sign him for a billion dollars and never ask where the servers sit.\nAn enterprise account paying a fraction of that wants to see his source code first.\n\nEffron asked how Nebius's customers https://t.co/AlR9vOBLyg https://t.co/gBIdnlLmiO", "url": "https://x.com/PodcastAlphaX/status/2117736285364236734"}, {"author_id": "2104979460109791232", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:11:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117726472278258153"], "id": "2117726472278258153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Building Hive - inspired brain model, trained from scratch.\n\nTonight at 230M:\n• 37% faster than Phi-1 at writing (228 vs 166 tokens/s, same GPU)\n\n• First HumanEval score after reading under 1% of Phi's training data\n\nGrowing to 460M overnight, hopefully nice results tomorrow.", "url": "https://x.com/tombarrett27/status/2117726472278258153"}, {"author_id": "2850666999", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:31:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117731445917507796"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HDfxiLJq5E", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MadMike_477/status/2117731445917507796/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117729840853868544", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/HDfxiLJq5E"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/HDfxiLJq5E", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MadMike_477/status/2117731445917507796/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117730155988647936", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/HDfxiLJq5E"}, {"display_url": "x.com/danielhanchen/…", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/danielhanchen/status/2117632087205589117", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/7GQO7eJq2U"}]}, "id": "2117731445917507796", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117632087205589117", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Awesome new Unsloth desktop update💚\n\n-New Glass themes, transparency + native macOS glass\nlots new Customization \n-Chat navigation to preview bookmark, jump early conversation \n-CPU only training and Fine-tune text models with no gpu\n\nt y Unsloth wizards 🦥💚🧙‍♂️ https://t.co/HDfxiLJq5E https://t.co/7GQO7eJq2U", "url": "https://x.com/MadMike_477/status/2117731445917507796"}, {"author_id": "2463869701", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:19:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117728367474516255"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 30, "id": "2070883514715615232", "start": 18, "username": "frontierllm"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zEdpKsHcV9", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/mmmatt/status/2117728367474516255/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2117728358955966464", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/zEdpKsHcV9"}]}, "id": "2117728367474516255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "my llm echonest @ @frontierllm grows smarter everyday\n\nstill training and inferencing on a cpu, no gpu involved in any part of the process\n\ncool stuff. it can do light coding now and can hold a convo. but still has so much room for improvement https://t.co/zEdpKsHcV9", "url": "https://x.com/mmmatt/status/2117728367474516255"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1940892740952473600", "name": "Asama Akhtar", "username": "asmDevsit"}, {"id": "864604226", "name": "Johnny", "username": "JohnnyNorthstar"}, {"id": "200924316", "name": "ZJ • x610ck 🐦‍🔥", "username": "x610ck"}, {"id": "2047141307861090304", "name": "Podcast Alpha", "username": "PodcastAlphaX"